#, x-machine
msgid "{} is no longer available"
msgstr "{} n'est plus disponible"

#. The OSD while a plugin that was stopped when idle starts again for its first use.
#: src/host/lazy.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "Starting {}…"
msgstr "Démarrage de {}…"

#. The OSD when a plugin stopped while idle cannot start again for its first use.
#: src/host/lazy.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "{} could not start"
msgstr "Impossible de démarrer {}"

#. The OSD when a click on a plugin's command cannot be held: too many wait for it to start.
#: src/host/host/supervisor/actions.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "{} is busy"
msgstr "{} est occupé"

#. The OSD when a click waiting for a plugin to start finds it switched off.
#: src/host/host/supervisor/actions.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "{} is disabled"
msgstr "{} est désactivé"

#. The OSD when a plugin stopped by itself (it crashed); B4.
#: src/host/host/supervisor/actions.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "{} stopped unexpectedly"
msgstr "{} s'est arrêté de manière inattendue"

#. The OSD when a plugin stopped because its JavaScript heap passed its 512 MB cap; B4.
#: src/host/host/supervisor/actions.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "{} ran out of memory"
msgstr "{} n'a plus de mémoire"

#. The OSD when a plugin crashed too often (5 times in 10 minutes) and stays stopped until reloaded; B4.
#: src/host/host/supervisor/actions.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "{} stopped after repeated faults"
msgstr "{} s'est arrêté après des erreurs répétées"

#. The reason on a crashed plugin's menu items, and the OSD on a click, while it waits a moment before it may start again; B4.
#: src/host/host/supervisor/mod.rs src/host/host/supervisor/actions.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "{} stopped after a fault; try again in a moment"
msgstr "{} s'est arrêté après une erreur ; réessayez dans un instant"

#. The OSD once per start when plugin shaders are kept off because the last run ended while they were on.
#: src/host/diagnostics.rs
#, x-machine
msgid "Plugin shaders are off: the player ended unexpectedly while they were on"
